# Dev-loop artifacts that belong to a game tree, never to the repo or a release zip
# (docs/dev-loop.md, "Deploy audit 2026-09-06"):
#   *.delta / *.delta-state  tools/enc method-body deltas and the reloader's published sequence
#   driftmap-*.json          the compat rewriter's per-build map (allowlist-vetted, hand-placed)
#   build-*.json             the Resilience build fingerprint Core writes beside the address
#                            tables (tools/addresslib/.gitignore already hides it there)
#   progenitor-allow.txt     the operator's allowlist; nothing in this repo may create one
*.delta
*.delta-state
driftmap-*.json
build-*.json
progenitor-allow.txt

# local agent-runner config (machine paths)
.codex/

# live-rig run output (dated evidence stays outside the repository)
tools/live-rig/runs/

# Local agent notes, settings and permissions (machine-specific; never tracked)
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
